{"seq":1,"slug":"spectral-analysis","title":"频率分布认知与频谱分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/frequency-balance/spectral-analysis","wordCount":1922,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"频率分布认知与频谱分析\">频率分布认知与频谱分析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>频率平衡的起点是理解人耳如何感知频率，以及频谱分析工具如何把这种感知翻译成可见的图形。人耳对各频段的灵敏度并不均匀（2–5 kHz 最敏感），听觉对频率的分辨又基于临界频带——同频带内的强弱信号会相互遮蔽。本篇先建立这两条心理声学基础，再讲如何正确使用频谱分析仪、如何用参考混音校准目标，以及 LUFS 响度计量的意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"人耳听觉的频率感知特性\">人耳听觉的频率感知特性</h2><p>人耳对不同频率的灵敏度并非均匀——在 2–5 kHz 区间（语音基频谐波所在范围）最为敏感，而在低频和极高频区域灵敏度显著下降。这种非线性特性由 Fletcher-Munson 等响曲线（Equal-Loudness Contours，ISO 226:2003）精确描述。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>phon</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>dB SPL at 1 kHz</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_p(\\text{phon}) = L_p(\\text{dB SPL at 1 kHz})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">phon</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB SPL at 1 kHz</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在 80 phon 等响曲线上，1 kHz 的 80 dB SPL 听起来与 50 Hz 的约 100 dB SPL 等响。这意味着混音在低音量监听时低频会&quot;消失&quot;，导致混音师可能过度补偿低频。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>频段</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>听觉特征</th>\n<th>对应乐器能量</th>\n<th>混音角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sub-Bass</td>\n<td>20–60 Hz</td>\n<td>触觉振动</td>\n<td>808 底鼓、Sub Synth</td>\n<td>体感冲击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bass</td>\n<td>60–250 Hz</td>\n<td>温暖、力量</td>\n<td>贝斯基频、踢鼓泛音</td>\n<td>节奏根基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Low-Mid</td>\n<td>250–500 Hz</td>\n<td>浑浊区</td>\n<td>吉他低位、人声胸声</td>\n<td>需谨慎控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mid</td>\n<td>500–2 kHz</td>\n<td>鼻音、身体感</td>\n<td>人声主体、吉他核心</td>\n<td>情感表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Upper-Mid</td>\n<td>2–5 kHz</td>\n<td>存在感、攻击</td>\n<td>辅音、吉他拨弦</td>\n<td>清晰度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Presence</td>\n<td>5–8 kHz</td>\n<td>明亮、齿音</td>\n<td>镲片、弦乐泛音</td>\n<td>空气感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Air</td>\n<td>8–20 kHz</td>\n<td>空气、光泽</td>\n<td>泛音尾端、房间空气</td>\n<td>开放感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;20 Hz&lt;br/&gt;Sub-Bass&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;60 Hz&lt;br/&gt;Bass&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;250 Hz&lt;br/&gt;Low-Mid&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;500 Hz&lt;br/&gt;Mid&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;2 kHz&lt;br/&gt;Upper-Mid&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;5 kHz&lt;br/&gt;Presence&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;20 kHz&lt;br/&gt;Air&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;人耳最敏感区&lt;br/&gt;2-5 kHz&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"20 Hz&lt;br/&gt;Sub-Bass\"] --&gt; B[\"60 Hz&lt;br/&gt;Bass\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"250 Hz&lt;br/&gt;Low-Mid\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"500 Hz&lt;br/&gt;Mid\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"2 kHz&lt;br/&gt;Upper-Mid\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"5 kHz&lt;br/&gt;Presence\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"20 kHz&lt;br/&gt;Air\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"人耳最敏感区&lt;br/&gt;2-5 kHz\"]</pre><h2 id=\"频谱分析工具的正确使用\">频谱分析工具的正确使用</h2><p>频谱分析仪（Spectrum Analyzer）将时域信号转换为频率域表示，帮助混音师&quot;看见&quot;频率分布。常用分析参数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X(k) = \\sum_{n=0}^{N-1} x[n] \\cdot w[n] \\cdot e^{-j2\\pi kn/N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w[n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 为窗函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为 FFT 点数。分析的频率分辨率与时间分辨率互为trade-off：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta f = \\frac{f_s}{N}, \\quad \\Delta t = \\frac{N}{f_s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>FFT 点数</th>\n<th>频率分辨率 (48 kHz)</th>\n<th>时间分辨率</th>\n<th>适合分析内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>46.9 Hz</td>\n<td>21 ms</td>\n<td>瞬态、节奏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>23.4 Hz</td>\n<td>43 ms</td>\n<td>通用平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>11.7 Hz</td>\n<td>85 ms</td>\n<td>低频细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8192</td>\n<td>5.9 Hz</td>\n<td>170 ms</td>\n<td>精确基频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16384</td>\n<td>2.9 Hz</td>\n<td>341 ms</td>\n<td>调音分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中应使用 1/3 倍频程或 1/6 倍频程显示模式——这更接近人耳的对数频率感知，使低频和高频区域获得视觉上的等权重。</p>\n<p>频谱分析的常见误区：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>为什么错</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>追求&quot;平坦&quot;频谱</td>\n<td>好混音不是白噪声</td>\n<td>参考曲线因流派而异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只看频谱混音</td>\n<td>相位/瞬态不可见</td>\n<td>耳朵优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性频率轴</td>\n<td>低频信息压缩</td>\n<td>使用对数轴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瞬时显示</td>\n<td>峰值闪烁无意义</td>\n<td>使用平均/加权</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[时域信号 x[n]&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;加窗&lt;br/&gt;Hann/Blackman&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;FFT 变换&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;幅度谱&lt;br/&gt;线性/dB&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;显示模式&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;线性频率&quot;| F[&quot;技术诊断&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;对数频率&quot;| G[&quot;混音判断&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;1/3 Oct&quot;| H[&quot;频段平衡&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[时域信号 x[n]\"] --&gt; B[\"加窗&lt;br/&gt;Hann/Blackman\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"FFT 变换\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"幅度谱&lt;br/&gt;线性/dB\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"显示模式\"}\n    E --&gt;|\"线性频率\"| F[\"技术诊断\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"对数频率\"| G[\"混音判断\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"1/3 Oct\"| H[\"频段平衡\"]</pre><h2 id=\"参考混音的频谱特征\">参考混音的频谱特征</h2><p>不同音乐风格有各自的&quot;目标频谱形状&quot;。通过分析经典参考混音的长期平均频谱（LTAS, Long-Term Average Spectrum），可以建立直觉判断基准。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LTAS</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>M</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LTAS}(f) = \\frac{1}{M}\\sum_{m=1}^{M}|X_m(f)|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LTAS</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型风格的频谱特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>低频特征</th>\n<th>中频特征</th>\n<th>高频特征</th>\n<th>整体斜率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>现代流行</td>\n<td>强烈 Sub + Bass</td>\n<td>清晰人声凸起</td>\n<td>明亮但控制</td>\n<td>约 -3 dB/oct</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>摇滚</td>\n<td>紧实有力</td>\n<td>吉他密集</td>\n<td>镲片能量高</td>\n<td>约 -2 dB/oct</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电子/EDM</td>\n<td>极端 Sub-Bass</td>\n<td>中频让位</td>\n<td>闪烁高频</td>\n<td>笑脸曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>爵士</td>\n<td>自然温暖</td>\n<td>饱满</td>\n<td>柔和滚降</td>\n<td>约 -4 dB/oct</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>古典</td>\n<td>丰富但不夸张</td>\n<td>高度线性</td>\n<td>自然延伸</td>\n<td>约 -4 dB/oct</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嘻哈/Trap</td>\n<td>极强 808</td>\n<td>人声为王</td>\n<td>选择性闪光</td>\n<td>双峰分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>使用参考曲目时的工作流：将参考曲目导入 DAW 独立轨道，通过 A/B 对比反复切换。匹配的不是精确的频谱曲线，而是&quot;能量感觉&quot;——低频是否有同等的体感冲击，高频是否有相似的开放度。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>频谱差异</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>dB (per band)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{频谱差异} = \\sum_{b=1}^{B}\\left|L_{mix}(b) - L_{ref}(b)\\right| \\quad \\text{dB (per band)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">频谱差异</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB (per band)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"临界频带与遮蔽效应\">临界频带与遮蔽效应</h2><p>听觉系统的频率分辨基于临界频带（Critical Band / Bark Scale）——耳蜗基底膜上约 24 个等宽的分析滤波器组。同一临界频带内的声音会相互竞争，强信号会&quot;遮蔽&quot;弱信号。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Bark</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.00076</mn><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3.5</mn><mi>arctan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>f</mi><mn>7500</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bark}(f) = 13 \\arctan(0.00076f) + 3.5 \\arctan\\left(\\frac{f}{7500}\\right)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bark</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arctan</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.00076</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">arctan</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7500</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>频率遮蔽（Frequency Masking）是混音中频率冲突的声学本质：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>遮蔽类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>混音影响</th>\n<th>解决策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同时遮蔽</td>\n<td>同频带强弱竞争</td>\n<td>弱乐器消失</td>\n<td>频率让位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向上遮蔽</td>\n<td>低频遮蔽高频更强</td>\n<td>Bass 吞噬 Guitar</td>\n<td>Bass HPF / Guitar boost</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间遮蔽</td>\n<td>强信号后短暂遮蔽</td>\n<td>瞬态被掩盖</td>\n<td>侧链压缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>向上遮蔽（Upward Masking）尤其重要——低频乐器对高频乐器的遮蔽效果远强于反向。这解释了为什么混音中低频管理是第一优先级：如果低频失控，整个混音的清晰度都会下降。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>遮蔽阈值提升</mtext><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{遮蔽阈值提升} \\propto L_{masker} \\cdot f_{masker}^{-\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">遮蔽阈值提升</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1128em;vertical-align:-0.2914em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4086em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2914em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际操作中，当两个乐器在同一频段发生冲突时，解决方案并非总是&quot;一切一加&quot;。需要判断哪个乐器在该频段更重要（叙事角色），让次要乐器在该频段让位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lufs-与响度感知计量\">LUFS 与响度感知计量</h2><p>现代混音越来越多地使用 LUFS（Loudness Units Full Scale）替代峰值电平作为响度参考。LUFS 基于 ITU-R BS.1770 算法，通过 K-weighting 滤波器模拟人耳频率灵敏度后计算 RMS：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.691</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{LUFS} = -0.691 + 10\\log_{10}\\left(\\frac{1}{T}\\int_0^T \\sum_{c} G_c \\cdot y_c^2(t)\\ dt\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">LU</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.691</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5912em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为通道权重（左/右 = 1.0，中置 = 1.0，环绕 = 1.41），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为 K-weighted 信号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台/标准</th>\n<th>目标响度</th>\n<th>True Peak 限制</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Spotify</td>\n<td>-14 LUFS</td>\n<td>-1 dBTP</td>\n<td>音乐流媒体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apple Music</td>\n<td>-16 LUFS</td>\n<td>-1 dBTP</td>\n<td>音乐流媒体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YouTube</td>\n<td>-14 LUFS</td>\n<td>-1 dBTP</td>\n<td>视频平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EBU R128</td>\n<td>-23 LUFS</td>\n<td>-1 dBTP</td>\n<td>欧洲广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ATSC A/85</td>\n<td>-24 LKFS</td>\n<td>-2 dBTP</td>\n<td>北美电视</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Netflix</td>\n<td>-27 LUFS (Dialogue)</td>\n<td>-2 dBTP</td>\n<td>流媒体影视</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;音频信号&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;K-weighting&lt;br/&gt;频率加权&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;均方计算&lt;br/&gt;Mean Square&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;积分&lt;br/&gt;400ms / 3s&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;dB 转换&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;LUFS 读数&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G{&quot;门控判断&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;低于 -70 LUFS&quot;| H[&quot;丢弃静默&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;低于相对阈值 -10&quot;| I[&quot;丢弃低电平&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"音频信号\"] --&gt; B[\"K-weighting&lt;br/&gt;频率加权\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"均方计算&lt;br/&gt;Mean Square\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"积分&lt;br/&gt;400ms / 3s\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"dB 转换\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"LUFS 读数\"]\n    D --&gt; G{\"门控判断\"}\n    G --&gt;|\"低于 -70 LUFS\"| H[\"丢弃静默\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"低于相对阈值 -10\"| I[\"丢弃低电平\"]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>人耳灵敏度随频率非线性变化（Fletcher-Munson 等响曲线），2–5 kHz 最敏感，故低音量监听会丢失低频感知。</li>\n<li>频谱分析仪将时域转为频域，FFT 点数决定频率/时间分辨率的 trade-off；应使用对数频率轴与平均显示，避免&quot;追求平坦&quot;和&quot;只看频谱&quot;两大误区。</li>\n<li>不同风格的 LTAS（长期平均频谱）各有形状，参考曲目应匹配&quot;能量感觉&quot;而非精确曲线。</li>\n<li>临界频带与遮蔽效应是频率冲突的声学本质；向上遮蔽使低频管理成为清晰度的第一优先级。</li>\n<li>LUFS（ITU-R BS.1770 K-weighting）比峰值更贴近响度感知，各平台有明确的目标响度与 True Peak 限制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../frequency-balance/eq-types\">均衡器类型与参数精解</a>：本篇定位的问题频段，用该篇的滤波器类型与 Q 值策略来精确修正。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../frequency-balance/spectral-conflict\">频谱冲突解决与多轨 EQ 策略</a>：本篇的临界频带与遮蔽效应，在该篇落地为多轨冲突诊断与互补 EQ。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/fft-fundamentals\">FFT 基础</a>（音频信号处理）：本篇频谱分析仪的 FFT 点数与频率分辨率，其数学原理在此完整推导。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../recording-acoustics/acoustics-foundations/sound-physics-hearing\">声音物理与听觉</a>（录音与声学）：本篇 Fletcher-Munson 等响曲线与临界频带的听觉生理基础，在此从声学心理学展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"频率分布认知与频谱分析","id":"频率分布认知与频谱分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"人耳听觉的频率感知特性","id":"人耳听觉的频率感知特性"},{"level":2,"text":"频谱分析工具的正确使用","id":"频谱分析工具的正确使用"},{"level":2,"text":"参考混音的频谱特征","id":"参考混音的频谱特征"},{"level":2,"text":"临界频带与遮蔽效应","id":"临界频带与遮蔽效应"},{"level":2,"text":"LUFS 与响度感知计量","id":"lufs-与响度感知计量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"总线路由与混音架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/signal-flow/bus-routing"},"next":{"title":"均衡器类型与参数精解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/frequency-balance/eq-types"}}